  "details": "After the 2020.3.2p3 release I experience something called \"knee-knock\" with all avatars 2.0 in FBT. Even though the fix supposed to get rid of \"knee-knock\" issue on avatars 2.0, it only made it much worse.\nThe issue really shows itself when sitting down or crouching in FBT. The position of the feet doesn't make much difference.\nNot sure if I can clearly show the issue on the screenshot, but attaching it anyways.\nThe release notes page:\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202032p3",
